{"id":"3dcd796412c3d198","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-key-lemma-forcing.md","title":"Key Lemma in Forcing","display":"thm-key-lemma-forcing — Key Lemma in Forcing","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-key-lemma-forcing","aliases":["58-thm-key-lemma-forcing"],"display":"thm-key-lemma-forcing — Key Lemma in Forcing","depends_on":["[[58-df-generic]]","[[58-df-dense]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-key-lemma-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-key-lemma-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-key-lemma-forcing — Key Lemma in Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"58-df-generic\">58-df-generic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"58-df-dense\">58-df-dense</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P},D,G\">\\(M,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P},D,G\\)</span> (model and forcing parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P})\">\\(\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span> (dense subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"681e6314e26cdd0b\" href=\"?note=681e6314e26cdd0b\" title=\"58-df-dense\">58-df-dense</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}\\)</span> (generic filter predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}key\\text{-}lemma\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\Bigl(D\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P},M)\\Bigr)\\to G\\cap D\\ne\\emptyset\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}key\\text{-}lemma\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\Bigl(D\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P},M)\\Bigr)\\to G\\cap D\\ne\\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Generic filters over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> meet all dense subsets of the forcing poset that are elements of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>External dense sets are not covered by the definition of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-genericity.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-generic","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-generic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dense","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dense]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dense","status":"resolved","id":"681e6314e26cdd0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P})$ (dense subset predicate, see [[58-df-dense]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P},D,G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}key\\text{-}lemma\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\Bigl(D\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Dense}(D,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,\\le_{\\mathbb P},M)\\Bigr)\\to G\\cap D\\ne\\emptyset","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":953,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4251","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-key-lemma-forcing.md|58-thm-key-lemma-forcing]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["545853811ce0a4b6","681e6314e26cdd0b"]}